{1}{Greetings, traveler.  Long have I waited for you to come.}{Greetings, traveler.  Long have I waited for you to come.}{}{}{}{qu1139 4}
{2}{What?  What do you mean?}{}{5}{}{5}{}
{3}{Huh?  Whut you mean?}{}{-4}{}{5}{}
{5}{The signs, traveler.  You read them, did you not?  The Mural of Enlightenment, the Verses of the Wanderer, the objects you have assembled here today...all of these were signs I left for you.  And they were also signs for me...so that I would know you when you came...}{The signs, traveler.  You read them, did you not?  The Mural of Enlightenment, the Verses of the Wanderer, the objects you have assembled here today...all of these were signs I left for you.  And they were also signs for me...so that I would know you when you came...}{}{}{}{}
{6}{So you knew?  All this time you've just been waiting for me?}{}{5}{}{9}{}
{7}{Uh...so you just here waiting for me?}{}{-4}{}{9}{}
{9}{Yes, traveler.  I was blessed with the gift of seeing the future, and I knew that someday you would need my help.  So I am here, and you are here.  How is it that I can be of service?}{Yes, traveler.  I was blessed with the gift of seeing the future, and I knew that someday I would be needed to provide you with answers.  So I am here, and you are here.  Ask, and I shall answer as best I can...}{}{}{}{}
{10}{Actually, I had a few questions...}{}{5}{}{16}{}
{11}{I got lots of questions!}{}{-4}{}{16}{}
{16}{Then I shall do my best to answer...}{Then I shall do my best to answer...}{}{}{}{}
{17}{Where are the Vendigroth Ruins?}{}{5}{}{25}{lf1 1}
{18}{What can you tell me of the Vendigroth Device?}{}{5}{}{36}{}
{19}{I'm confused.  What role do I play in all of this?}{}{5}{}{42}{}
{20}{If you can see the future, how does all of this end...?}{}{5}{}{45}{}
{21}{I think that's all.  Thank you Pelojian...}{}{5}{lf1 1}{48}{}
{22}{Where Vendigroth ruin?}{}{-4}{}{25}{}
{23}{I gotta go!}{}{-4}{}{48}{}
{25}{The Vendigroth Ruins?  That's very easy, traveler. [The apparition points to a place on your map.]  A place of sorrow.  A place of death.}{The Vendigroth Ruins?  That's very easy, traveler. [The apparition points to a place on your map.]  A place of sorrow.  A place of death.}{}{}{}{mm 22}
{26}{What can you tell me about them?}{}{5}{}{30}{}
{27}{I have a few more questions...}{}{5}{}{16}{}
{28}{I got more questions!}{}{-4}{}{16}{}
{30}{Vendigroth was an amazing place, traveler.  There are wonders now, here in your time...but I tell you, Vendigroth was a city of marvels and wonders.  This thing you call technology...the people of Vendigroth mastered it long before the dwarves.  I can't even begin to describe the things they created...}{Vendigroth was an amazing place, traveler.  There are wonders now, here in your time...but I tell you, Vendigroth was a city of marvels and wonders.  This thing you call technology...the people of Vendigroth mastered it long before the dwarves.  I can't even begin to describe the things they created...}{}{}{}{}
{31}{But then Arronax became angry with them.  He feared technology...}{}{5}{}{33}{}
{33}{Yes, and he annihilated them because of it.  Tread carefully in the ruins of old Vendigroth, traveler.  The blood of its people still screams for retribution, for revenge.  It is an evil place, twisted by pain and fury.  Your journey there will not be an easy one...}{Yes, and he annihilated them because of it.  Tread carefully in the ruins of old Vendigroth, traveler.  The blood of its people still screams for retribution, for revenge.  It is an evil place, twisted by pain and fury.  Your journey there will not be an easy one...}{}{}{}{}
{34}{I have a few more questions...}{}{5}{}{16}{}
{36}{It was a device they created to destroy him.  And destroy him it would have, traveler.  If a machine can be thought of as evil, then this Vendigroth device would be called such...}{It was a device they created to destroy him.  And destroy him it would have, traveler.  If a machine can be thought of as evil, then this Vendigroth device would be called such...}{}{}{}{}
{37}{What does it do, exactly?}{}{5}{}{39}{}
{39}{Put very simply, it severs a soul from this world forever.  A person killed with this device can never return to the lands of the living.  It is the true and final death...the last step in the dark journey...}{Put very simply, it severs a soul from this world forever.  A person killed with this device can never return to the lands of the living.  It is the true and final death...the last step in the dark journey...}{}{}{}{}
{40}{I have a few more questions...}{}{5}{}{16}{}
{42}{Your role is a strange one, traveler.  On one hand, you might say that you are merely Fate's puppet, destined to play the role given you.  But if you look at it another way, it is you, and only you, that has any choice whatsoever; it is everyone else who dances to the strings.  In the end, how you see things is your decision, and your decision only...}{Your role is a strange one, traveler.  On one hand, you might say that you are merely Fate's puppet, destined to play the role given you.  But if you look at it another way, it is you, and only you, that has any choice whatsoever; it is everyone else who dances to the strings.  In the end, how you see things is your decision, and your decision only...}{}{}{}{}
{43}{An interesting viewpoint.  A few more questions...}{}{5}{}{16}{}
{45}{[Pelojian laughs.]  I knew you were going to ask that question.  Did you really expect an answer?}{[Pelojian laughs.]  I knew you were going to ask that question.  Did you really expect an answer?}{}{}{}{}
{46}{I suppose not.  A few more questions...}{}{5}{}{16}{}
{48}{Yes, I must go as well.  My long vigil is over, and I can finally go to my rest.  Fate has not yet chosen, and Death himself awaits.  Farewell, traveler...}{Yes, I must go as well.  My long vigil is over, and I can finally go to my rest.  Fate has not yet chosen, and Death himself awaits.  Farewell, traveler...}{}{}{}{lf2 1}
{49}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{gf2553 1}
{51}{I go now to my rest...}{I go now to my rest...}{}{}{}{}
{52}{[The spirit before you says nothing.]}{[The spirit before you says nothing.]}{}{}{}{}

